# ALGOL 60/68: Revised Report on the Algorithmic Language ALGOL 60 and ALGOL 68 Revised Report; requirements/languages/algol.md
name     algol algol60 algol68 a68
keyword  begin end if then else elif fi for from to by while do od step until goto go comment procedure
keyword  proc value own switch case in out esac mode op prio struct union heap loc
type     integer real boolean string array int bool char
builtin  true false print read
line-comment   #
string   " "  : doubled
operators  +-*/:=<>^&|~(),;
